.claude/

# Astro build inputs/outputs for the migrated Sonic Temple content.
# site-src/ holds the SOURCE (committed). Its dependencies and raw build output are not:
# `cd site-src && npm run build` regenerates dist/ and syncs the finished routes
# (/attune, /learn, /graphs, /measure, /support, /privacy, /_astro, /audio) to the repo root,
# and THOSE are committed, because GitHub Pages serves this repo as-is with no build step.
site-src/node_modules/
site-src/dist/
site-src/.astro/
